MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_001: Wow! That is one good-lookin' gal! I've gotta say hi\nto her.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_002: Perhaps I'll bring back a gift for milady...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_003: Whoa!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_004: What the... Dadao?
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_005: Are you able to stand? Apologies, I was deep in\nthought...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_006: Ouch... Aghhhh! No! She's gone!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_007: Hey, man. What's the big idea?! You just made me\nmiss my shot with that lady!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_008: Quite the bark you have. You're clearly alright.\nFeel free to go about your business.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_009: I'm not alright! Nothing's alright! She's gone now,\nand I don't even know her name!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_010: If you didn't even know her name, then I doubt she'd\nhave paid you any mind.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_011: Pfft, whatever. A woman that lovely would definitely\nbe all over me.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_012: She had a chance to...be all over you...as you say,\nand yet moved along. Ugh. This hurts my head.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_013: Please, feel free to go forth and endear yourself to\nwhichever ladies you like, Dadao.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_014: Wait, hang on. I've got it. To make up for it, you can\nintroduce me to Leda! You're friends with her, right?
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_015: Introduce you to...milady?
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_016: You heard me. It's your fault I missed my shot, so\nnow you can fix it by introducing me.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_017: Grrr...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_018: What's the holdup? Let's go. Leda's waiting!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_019: GRAAAH! I will bludgeon that foul, twisted mindset\nof yours back into shape.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_020: Whoa! Hey, back off!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_021: Close your mouth! I would never let someone as\ndisgraceful as you go near milady.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_022: Mark my words—I will beat the proper training\ninto you until you become a better kind of man.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_023: Hmph! The captain and master lectured me plenty.\nYou can't do anything they haven't tried.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_024: Then first, I will cure you of that cocky attitude.\nNow, apologize for bumping into ME!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_025: Yagh! Who cares? It wasn't a big deal...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_026: Stop talking! Hrah!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_027: Ow!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_028: I said apologize, or I will not forgive you!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_029: I... I'm sorry...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_030: Rrrrgh...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_031: I'm really sorry! Ugh! My...my tongue...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_032: Say it again, with a deeper bow. And explain to me\nwhat you did wrong EXACTLY!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_C_033: {SetColor=Gray}Ughhhh, what's up with this geezer...{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_001: Ughh. I've been training Dadao in hopes he will\none day become a decent man...
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_002: But he shows no sign of growth whatsoever.\nI'm at my wit's end.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_003: No, no, no. I cannot give up. I am the Demon Bear of\nBaphos, and I will not disgrace my name.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_004: Buccar! Good morrow! I anticipate a fruitful day\nwith you today.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_005: What is wrong with you, Dadao? Did you injure\nthat thick skull of yours?
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_006: Of what do you speak? My eyes are opened!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_007: I want to become a man as great as you.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_008: I...see. You have taken my teachings to heart at\nlast, then? I am truly touched.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_009: Indeed! For if I am, er, as...uh, upstanding as you,\nsurely the women will flock to me!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_010: That lout! His intentions remain as impure as ever.\nNothing has changed.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_011: If I learn proper etiquette, I will gain access to all the\nnoble women! Nyehehe.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_012: {SetColor=Gray}No, no, no! If I continue to teach him, I'll have\nhelped unleash a beast upon gentle society.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_013: {SetColor=Gray}I must stop him here and now. It is the only way!{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_014: Eh, Dadao... I wonder, have you truly considered\nwhat it means to become as upstanding as I am?
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_015: Whaddaya mean?
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_016: I've lived my life in pursuit of one thing only...loyalty.\nAnd so I remain without a partner to this very day.
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_017: Wait, you tricked me! How dare you waste my time!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_018: No one deceived you. You arrived at your own\ndepraved way of thinking!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_019: That's it—I'm done listening to your absurdities.\nI will pull out your tongue!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_020: Good luck with that. I'll beat you into the ground,\nand then you can't boss me around anymore!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_021: Impudent boor! Go ahead and try if you dare!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_022: I'm comin' for you! Hyaaah!
MID_SE_Buc_Dai_B_023: HYAAAGH!